            "value": "This is an \"environment for\" analogy. An OFFENSIVE (a noun here) is an event \u2014 a planned attack \u2014 that typically occurs during a WAR. Similarly, a dream is an event that typically occurs during slumber(deep sleep). As for choice (D), soccer is an event that might take place in a stadium. But to say that soccer usually occurs in a stadium would be an overstatement. Also, a stadium is a physical place, whereas WAR and slumber are events."
